    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm hitting a massive headache with our jenkins pipeline. we've got these intermittent failures during the unit test stage in our CI/CD flow. the code hasn't changed, but the builds are just... flaky. sometimes it passes, sometimes it fails with weird timeout errors or random asset loading failures. it's non-deterministic as hell. how can i start isolating whether this is an env issue or something in the container orchestration?",
