      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Start by thoroughly examining the Jenkins agent/container logs for any pattern in the failures, such as resource exhaustion or network instability. Run the tests locally or in a controlled, single-instance Docker environment matching your pipeline spec to see if the flakiness persists outside of Jenkins. If the issue remains, investigate container resource limits (CPU/Memory) and potential transient network latency between test runners and external services.",
