      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the suggestions. i tried running a few more builds in a local docker container and it seems to pass every time there, which is weird because the build agent in the cloud is where it constantly trips up. i've checked the cpu/mem usage and nothing looks like it's spiking to the point of a crash. is there anything else i should look at regarding how the agents are being provisioned? it feels like something is just messing with the execution randomly.",
